    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Bastion Task Force",
    "summary": "Your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES BATTLELINE** units can still do the following in a turn they Advance or Fall Back:\n\n- Shoot and declare a charge.\n- **Start an Action**.\n\nWhen one of those units has finished resolving the attacks it was selected to make, pick 1 enemy unit that at least one of them hit. Until the turn ends, that unit is auspex scanned, and **Hit rolls** of 1 may be re-rolled for attacks your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** models make against an auspex scanned unit.",
